  "translation": "Na long ples bilong nasia, ol ofa ol i kukim olgeta, na minkha, na ofa bilong drink i stap — long ol bikde, na long ol nupela mun, na long ol Sabat, long olgeta taim ol i makim bilong haus bilong Yisrael. Em i wokim ⟨את⟩ ofa bilong sin, na ⟨את⟩ minkha, na ⟨את⟩ ofa ol i kukim olgeta, na ⟨את⟩ ol ofa bilong pis, bilong klinim pela bilong haus bilong Yisrael.",
